      <title>索尼Xperia 10 VIII：屏幕更亮，但599欧元的中端机靠什么突围？</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260825/%E7%B4%A2%E5%B0%BCXperia-10-VIII%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E6%9B%B4%E4%BA%AE%E4%BD%86599%E6%AC%A7%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E7%AB%AF%E6%9C%BA%E9%9D%A0%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E7%AA%81%E5%9B%B4/</link>
